    sd:notes "Covers Features 22.1-22.5 (document subtitle: 'Data Collection & Compliance- Employee Assignment Details (22.1-22.5)'). Author Caitlin Groom (CEPI); approved by Beth Dontje (MDE) and Caitlin Groom (CEPI), both 08/05/2025 per the signoff table — but comments.xml contains entries dated through 2026-04-01, well after that signoff date, meaning the document continued to be actively revised/discussed after its nominal approval, same pattern FDD 29's own header noted for its document." .

staff:Fdd22CompanionDoc a sd:SourceDocument ;
    sd:docType "fdd" ;
    sd:section "functional-design-docs/22 - Data Collection & Compliance - Employee Assignment Details/21.7; 22.6 - Collection & Compliance - Employee and Appropriate Placement Audit.docx" ;
    sd:notes "Covers TWO FDDs' worth of content: Feature 21.7 (Employee Audit — an FDD-21 concern, deliberately NOT modeled in this file, left for FDD 21's own review pass per this session's scope) and Feature 22.6 (Appropriate Placement Audit — modeled below, Req_22_6_1 through Req_22_6_5). Same approver pair (Dontje/Groom), signed 08/04/2025; comments.xml runs through 2026-04-28, again well past nominal signoff." .

