staff:Wireframe22_04 a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "wireframe" ;
    sd:section "abox/mied-v3/fdd-review/22-employee-assignment-details/wireframes/wireframe-04-file-upload-identity-doctype.png" ;
    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: modern MiEdWorkforce 'File upload' screen, File Type dropdown defaulted to 'Identity', accepting only .doc/.docx/.pdf up to 1MB via a drag-and-drop control. Not captioned or referenced anywhere in the surrounding text. Its file-type/format shape (Identity-document upload, office-doc formats) does not match the Business Specifications section's own description of BULK Employee Roster file upload (Excel/CSV/XML formats) — these read as two distinct upload surfaces (a per-record supporting-identity-document upload vs. a bulk roster-data file upload) that the FDD's placement of this image doesn't clearly disambiguate. Not raised as a standalone Annotation given low impact (neither capability is targeted by a numbered 22.x story — Feature 22.4 explicitly defers file-upload stories to FDD 21.5) but noted here for traceability." ;
    sd:definedIn staff:Fdd22Doc .

